      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# FIBO 2 Dev Create\n\nNative TextEncodeFibo2 with shared Studio loader, sampler, references, prompts and save nodes. No FIBO-specific Studio nodes.\n\nFour optional references are <image_1> to <image_4>. Without references this is text-to-image. Studio Prompt Slot supplies output dimensions.\n\nSample the encoder latent output. Keep VAE connected for reference latents. Empty negative is intentional. Dev defaults: 50 Euler/simple steps, CFG 5, denoise 1. Native FIBO supplies its sampling shift.\n\nPrompt Settings configures Studio preparation; on the canvas it passes text through. The encoder accepts plain text or a result VGL JSON caption with edit_instruction for editing; no automatic VGL expansion is provided here.\n\nEdit framing should match the source. Start near 1 MP; larger output is not a quality guarantee. LoRA stack is optional and requires FIBO-compatible weights. PNG preserves saved pixels; unmasked model edits can still drift.\n\nSetup reuses installed encoders/VAE and checks model terms. Sources: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Fibo-2.0 and https://huggingface.co/briaai/Fibo-2.0-dev"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
